  dialogueText: '"You''re doing something very important right now-you are using
    your voice.

    In Ilokano, ''agsao'' means ''speak.''

    You can use it when
    talking about speaking with another person or practicing a language.

    Listen
    carefully: agsao.

    Now, try saying ''agsao'' yourself."

'
